<title>USA: Genesis Intl Financial sees Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Genesis Intl Financial sees Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genesis International Financial Services Inc said it is on target to post earnings per share of $0.15 in the first quarter.</p>
<p>In last year's first quarter, Genesis reported earnings of $90,250, or nil cents per share.</p>
